公子翩翩行，白衣荡荡飘；身配七尺剑，手盈一洞箫；若遇一知己，且听悠悠曲；曲罢拱手去，何处不逍遥。
A gentleman strides with elegant grace,
White garments flowing through time and space;
Seven-foot sword hangs at his noble side,
A jade flute in hand, his spirit's guide;
If fortune brings a soulmate near,
He'll play melodies for them to hear;
When the last note fades, he bows and goes—
No bonds constrain where freedom flows.

[h1]WOW!!![/h1]

[h2]This is a triple-A, highly polished work of art. It EASILY competes with and beats out, most $70 - $90 games but is [i]FREE to play[/i] (I almost can't believe it!).[/h2]

- The quality of story-telling is more enthralling than most other games of it's kind. {B+}
- The graphics are outstanding - well, you see the video on the Store page, right? {B+}
- Movement and controls are excellent both for controller and KB/Mouse! {A}
- Difficulty levels actually make a difference so you can have an easy time or be actually challenged! {A}
- Emersion isn't broken by politics or developer messaging! {A+}
- Combat (weapon diversity, availability and use mechanics) are all top notch! {B+}
- Learning curves are tuned for maximum emersion and fun on all difficulty modes! {B}
- Audible dialogue doesn't exist for for every character and circumstance but all the important bits are there. I have a feeling this will be addressed in future updates. {C+}
- Audible and text dialogue is interesting, to the point, and refreshingly unannoying! {B}
- In-game community support and direction is excellent - quite a nice community experience! {B}

[h3]Yup, if you liked Elden Ring, Elder Scrolls Online (without the ads), or Wukong Black Myths then you will like playing this!  Highly recommended - and hey, [i]it's FREE to play! [/i] [/h3]
